== text ==
Best,
Sam

Sam Taylor (she/her)
سام تايلور
Principal Engineer, Cloud & AI
Platform Engineering | Contoso Europe
M: +1 425 555 0142 | O: +1 425 555 0100 | sam.taylor@contoso.com | contoso.com
Lisbon, Portugal
Hours: Sun to Thu, 9:00 to 17:00
Languages: English, Arabic
LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/sample | GitHub: github.com/sample | X: x.com/sample | YouTube: youtube.com/@sample | Microsoft Learn: learn.microsoft.com/users/sample | Blog: sample.dev/blog
Book time: https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/abc
Building things people love to use
Join us at Build: https://build.microsoft.com

This message may contain confidential information.
"
`;

